<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>A N C Airpod Pro TWS</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;500;700&family=Montserrat:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #111;
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        }
        header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 50px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .product-image {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 300px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .product-image img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .product-image img:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }
        .product-details {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 300px;
        }
        .product-details h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #111;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        }
        .product-details p {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }
        .price {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #e53935;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }
        .btn-buy {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e53935, #d32f2f);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 35px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 15px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.4s;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .btn-buy:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 25px rgba(229,57,53,0.4);
        }
        .features, .reviews {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 40px 60px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            max-width: 1000px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }
        .features h3, .reviews h3 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: #111;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        }
        .features ul {
            list-style: none;
        }
        .features li {
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }
        .reviews .review {
            padding: 18px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .reviews .review:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .review strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: #111;
        }
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px;
            background-color: #111;
            color: white;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 60px;
        }
        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .container {
                flex-direction: column-reverse;
                gap: 30px;
            }
            .product-image img {
                max-width: 90%;
            }
            .features, .reviews {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>A N C Airpod Pro TWS</h1>
</header>

<div class="container">
    <div class="product-image">
        <img src="14c6a899-76c1-45cf-957f-599fdcd504b1.png" alt="A N C Airpod Pro">
    </div>
    <div class="product-details">
        <h2>Premium True Wireless Earphones</h2>
        <p><strong>Color:</strong> White</p>
        <p><strong>Compatibility:</strong> All Smartphones</p>
        <p><strong>Battery Charge Time:</strong> 1 Hour</p>
        <p><strong>Play Time:</strong> 10 Hours</p>
        <p><strong>Bluetooth Range:</strong> 10m</p>
        <p><strong>Noise Cancelling:</strong> Yes</p>
        <p><strong>Mic:</strong> Yes</p>
        <p><strong>Type:</strong> TWS</p>
        <p class="price">₹4,999</p>
        <button class="btn-buy">Buy Now</button>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="features">
    <h3>Features</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Ultra-lightweight and ergonomic design for comfort.</li>
        <li>Crystal clear sound with deep bass.</li>
        <li>Seamless connectivity with all smartphones.</li>
        <li>Noise cancellation for immersive listening experience.</li>
        <li>Compact charging case for on-the-go charging.</li>
    </ul>
</div>

<div class="reviews">
    <h3>Customer Reviews</h3>
    <div class="review">
        <strong>Ravi K.</strong>
        <p>Excellent sound quality and battery life. Totally worth it!</p>
    </div>
    <div class="review">
        <strong>Priya S.</strong>
        <p>Comfortable to wear, and noise cancellation works perfectly.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="review">
        <strong>Arjun M.</strong>
        <p>Stylish design and easy connectivity. Very happy with the purchase.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<footer>
    &copy; 2025 A N C. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
